<http://www.semanticweb.org/ontologies/2022/titutuli/nivedita/drmo#AssociatedConsideration> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> "Associated Consideration demand extra attention for using dental material objects. Manufactured object participates in some recommended dental procedure. Few associated conditions do not allow the recommended procedures to be performed in the conventional way.\nClinicians had to modify the material selection process for that specific condition.  \nManufacturers modify few objects for some specific dental conditions like high stress area, sub gingival area, low occlusal clearance, area with more saliva, edge-to-edge bite, restoration in asthmatic patients, epileptic patients." .
